        {
          "id": "lead-t",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p>I acted as the central vision holder across design, programming and art — mentoring team members, unblocking cross-discipline dependencies, and keeping product goals aligned so the mechanics and the creative stayed coherent.</p>"
        }
